  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]\n[Ddim7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]Chaos A.D\nTanks on the streets Con-\nfronting police\nBleeding the plebs\nRaging crowd\nBurning cars\nBloodshed starts Who'll\nbe alive?\n\n[Bridge]\n[Ddim7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]Chaos A.D\nArmy in siege\nTotal alarm\nI'm sick of this\nInside the state\nWar is created\nNo man's land What\nis this shit?\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb][F#]Re-\n[Dm]fuse\n[G#][F#]re-\n[Dm]sist\n[Bb][F#]Re-\n[Dm]fuse\n[G#]  [F#]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Bm]  [F]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]  [F]\n[Bm]\n\n[Solo]\n[Em]\n[Bm]  [F]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]  [F]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]  [F]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]  [F]\n[Bm]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Ddim7]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Dm]Chaos A.D Di-\nsorder unleashed\nStarting to burn\nStarting to lynch\nSilence means death\nStand on your feet\nInner fear Your\nworst enemy\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb][F#]Re-\n[Dm]fuse\n[G#][F#]re-\n[Dm]sist\n[Bb][F#]Re-\n[Dm]fuse\n[G#][F#]re-\n\n[Break]\n[Ddim7]sist\n\n[Outro]\n[Dm]",
